# 自有文字跨平台固定 LF；下方來源／雜湊證據必須完全保留 Git 內的原位元組。
* text=auto eol=lf
# Preserve PDF fixtures byte-for-byte; their hashes and xref offsets matter.
*.pdf binary
# Preserve upstream legal texts exactly, including original line endings.
src/desktop_app/data/licenses/** -text
# 工程產物為歷史證據，保留原位元組；日誌與原始生成 Markdown 不修剪當時空白。
docs/development-records/screenshots/** -text
docs/development-records/examples/** -text
docs/development-records/examples/*-example.md -whitespace
docs/development-records/examples/sparse-fixed.md -whitespace
docs/development-records/examples/upstream-borderless-result.md -whitespace
docs/development-records/logs/*.log -text -whitespace
docs/development-records/observations/*.json -text
vendor/** -text
packaging/** -text
docs/development-records/** -text
docs/development-records/runs/**/*.log -whitespace
docs/development-records/runs/**/*.txt -whitespace
docs/architecture/versions/** -text
LICENSE -text
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES -text
